{'symbol': 'MPC', 'date': '2023-01-30 07:35:00', 'title': 'MARATHON PETROLEUM CORPORATION ANNOUNCES ELECTION OF NEW DIRECTOR', 'text': "FINDLAY, OHIO , JAN. 30, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MARATHON PETROLEUM CORP. (NYSE: MPC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT TONI TOWNES-WHITLEY HAS BEEN ELECTED TO THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE MARCH 1, 2023. TOWNES-WHITLEY IS A GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY LEADER WHOSE CAREER SPANS MORE THAN 35 YEARS, MOST RECENTLY AS PRESIDENT OF U.S. REGULATED INDUSTRIES AT MICROSOFT CORPORATION."}